{"id":"6938939073","t":"A Regressor’s Tale of Cultivation","c":"cv","n":38,"l":38,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation"},"u":1795038547948,"desc":"سقط سبعة أشخاصٍ في عالم الخالدين وقد بدا أن كلاً منهم ازدهر فيه بفضل موهبةٍ مباركة خُص بها ما عدا سيو أون هيون الذي لم يظهر لهُ أي قوى. إلا أن الحقيقة أنه امتلك قدرةً على التراجع اللامتناهي…غير أنها لم تكن نعمةً بل لعنة. وهكذا تبدأ حكاية سيو أون هيون وكفاحه اليائس للهروب من دوامة التراجع التي لا نهاية لها.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اكشن","ايسكاى","دراما","صقل","فنتازيا","فنون قتاليه"],"src":{"ml":"a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation|/manga/a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation/1_1/"},"2":{"ml":"a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation|/manga/a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation/2/"},"3":{"ml":"a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation|/manga/a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation/3/"},"4":{"ml":"a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation|/manga/a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation/4/"},"5":{"ml":"a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation|/manga/a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation/5/"},"6":{"ml":"a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation|/manga/a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation/6/"},"7":{"ml":"a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation|/manga/a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation/7/"},"8":{"ml":"a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation|/manga/a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation/8/"},"9":{"ml":"a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation|/manga/a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation/9/"},"10":{"ml":"a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation|/manga/a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation/10/"},"11":{"ml":"a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation|/manga/a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation/11/"},"12":{"ml":"a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation|/manga/a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation/12/"},"13":{"ml":"a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation|/manga/a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation/13/"},"14":{"ml":"a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation|/manga/a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation/14/"},"15":{"ml":"a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation|/manga/a-regressors-tale-of-cultivation/15/"},"16":{"ml":"a-regressor